WEBVTT

00:01.360 --> 00:02.760
Good.

00:04.200 --> 00:05.680
General Shilang is decisive.

00:05.760 --> 00:09.760
General, please rise but I have one more condition.

00:09.920 --> 00:11.920
That imperial jade seal.

00:12.920 --> 00:18.320
That seal I lost it when I was driven out now.

00:18.400 --> 00:20.400
I don't know where it is.

00:22.200 --> 00:27.400
Forget it someone give the general weapons and supplies.

00:27.520 --> 00:30.667
I'll also give the general two hundred sets of armor.

00:31.400 --> 00:34.560
General must help me block Qingzhou Army.

00:34.760 --> 00:37.440
Your Highness wait for my news.

00:45.000 --> 00:58.000
Thereupon, they immediately reneged on their pledge, turning instead to attack the Yuyang and Yiyang regions with no intention whatsoever of obstructing the Qingzhou Army.

00:58.200 --> 01:04.500
A few days later, the main force of the Qingzhou Army caught up with you after all, and you were forced to engage them.

01:04.920 --> 01:10.520
After days of bitter fighting still unable to achieve victory causing morale to gradually collapse.

01:10.800 --> 01:15.120
Many worry the court will later settle accounts and execute them defect one after another.

01:15.280 --> 01:18.160
You unfortunately die tragically in the chaos.

